msgctxt "148"
msgid ""
"I'm so very sorry, sir. I know you specifically requested the sea bream, but"
" it's out of my hands..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "160"
msgid ""
"Don't give me your excuses! Do you realize I reserved that fish an entire "
"month in advance!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "172"
msgid "Excuse me... Can I see what's fresh today?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "184"
msgid "Wait, aren't you that fellow from Nakahara-san's⑬"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "196"
msgid "That's me. I'm Kiryu. Now, what's the problem here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "208"
msgid ""
"Well... This gentleman reserved the Ryukyu sea bream, but I may have sold it"
" to a local restaurant..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "220"
msgid "What, is it rare?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "232"
msgid ""
"Quite rare! It can only be caught off the shores of the Ryukyu Islands. Once"
" you try it, well... it's a life-changing experience."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "244"
msgid ""
"My daughter and her husband are coming home, and I wanted to celebrate with "
"her favorite sashimi!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "256"
msgid "I see..."
msgstr "Capisco..."

msgctxt "268"
msgid ""
"Can't you get it back from the guy you sold it to? You know, just give him a"
" refund?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "280"
msgid ""
"In theory, maybe... But we're talking about a big, brawny guy. A real beast "
"of a chef."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "292"
msgid ""
"I told him up front I couldn't sell the fish, but he made it clear I didn't "
"have much choice..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "304"
msgid ""
"Hey, I know! You're tough enough to stand up to him, Kiryu-san. Could you "
"get the Ryukyu sea bream back?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "316"
msgid ""
"Please! I can pay you for it⑬up to 200,000 yen, even. You'd be doing the two"
" of us a big favor, so..."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "328"
msgid "Sorry, but I don't think I can help you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "340"
msgid "But... I thought the Ryudo Family was sworn to help the weak!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "352"
msgid "If you change your mind, come back⑬I'm begging you!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "400"
msgid "I guess I have to. Where is this restaurant, anyway?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "412"
msgid ""
"You mean you'll do it? Thank you so much! The restaurant is next to a place "
"called <Color:7>South Island<Color:Default> on <Color:7>Hatsumachi "
"South<Color:Default>."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "424"
msgid "Oh, and here's the 200,000 yen. Good luck! I know you can do it!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "436"
msgid "You got <Color:8>200,000 yen<Color:Default>."
msgstr "Hai ottenuto <Color:8>200.000 yen<Color:Default>."

msgctxt "448"
msgid "Got it, <Color:7>Hatsumachi South<Color:Default>. I'm on my way."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "508"
msgid "Kiryu-san! Can you go track down that Ryukyu sea bream for us?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "520"
msgid "Help Him"
msgstr "Aiutalo"

